      "content": "therapy doesn't really change the fact that things are bad. the money is gone, the stress is constant... it's just one big loop of me failing them. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just dragging them down into the dirt with me. they'd be so much lighter without all my problems hanging over their head.",
